ors.\nBattery EN divider 100k/27.4k: nominal rising UVLO about 5.6V, NOT cell protection.\n3V3 target 1A total, sensor/expansion budget 150mA. Quiet sensor branch uses ferrite + local caps." (at 20.32 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "348129c6-fff5-46c6-b41e-8694cd8d19a5")) (embedded_fonts no))
